# Abrade, second mode: "Destroy target artifact." Bot2 has a Guerrilla Gorilla (a creature, not an artifact), an
# Ornithopter (an artifact creature) and a Sol Ring (an artifact). On turn 5 Bot1's first Abrade refuses the Gorilla and
# destroys the Ornithopter -- an artifact creature is an artifact; its second Abrade destroys the Sol Ring. The
# Gorilla is untouched throughout: the damage mode is the only one that hits creatures as creatures.

